WEBVTT

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:20.780
Makoto's girlfriend slapped me.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.360
You're his girlfriend, right?

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.240
Makoto hasn't broken up with Katsura-san.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.940
Makoto's girlfriend is still Katsura-san.

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:36.280
But you've been staying at his house.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:38.520
That's all my doing. That's all.

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.640
Are you okay with this?

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.140
Of course not.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.200
But that's the way it is.

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.090
I'll go see how Itou actually feels.

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:53.280
You don't have to do that, Setsuna.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:57.770
No, this is for me. I don't have much time left.

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:49.830
Makoto!

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:51.170
What?

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:54.820
Is it true you're still going out with Katsura-san?

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:56.840
Wh-Who told you that?!

00:02:56.840 --> 00:02:59.010
That's what Katsura-san was saying.

00:02:59.010 --> 00:02:59.560
Huh?

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:01.340
That the two of you haven't broken up.

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:04.530
So what's going on?

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:12.370
Well, I guess women and men don't always agree exactly on what their relationship is.

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:15.270
You're saying things like you know from experience!

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:19.960
Just how far do you plan on leaving me behind and running up the stairs to adulthood?!

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:38.660
Saionji-san, you knew he was my boyfriend...

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:40.250
I'm sorry.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.430
How?

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.440
How could you do something like that?

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:51.460
Because Makoto needed me...

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:54.740
But Makoto-kun is dating me!

00:03:55.280 --> 00:04:00.560
You're the one who encouraged me to talk to him when I didn't have the courage to.

00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:01.860
I'm sorry...

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:06.440
I thought you were a good person.

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:09.160
I thought you were a friend!

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:16.440
Please, I'm his girlfriend...

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:19.110
Please don't go near him anymore!

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:23.770
Please...

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:40.880
So we'll be canceling afternoon classes tomorrow and preparing for the School Fair.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.650
Furthermore, regarding the start of the fair the day after tomorrow,

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:46.270
all the details you need to know are written on the printout you have in front of you.

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:47.990
Please read it thoroughly.

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:53.700
Makoto-kun, want to go home together?

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:56.530
Sure.

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:57.200
No.

00:04:58.350 --> 00:04:59.830
Why?

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:01.540
Itou has something to do.

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:02.870
I don't really.

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:05.450
The classroom inspection we just heard about in the meeting.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.600
We can just do that tomorrow.

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:08.670
We're doing it today.

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:10.020
Can I wait?

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:11.460
It'll be a while.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.840
It shouldn't take that long, right?

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:17.120
Probably like, what, thirty minutes?

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.690
Two full hours.

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:21.640
I-It shouldn't take that long.

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:24.650
Itou, are you saying that going home with Katsura-san...

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:26.940
...is more important than your work on the School Fair Board?

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:32.390
It's okay.

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:35.000
I'm sorry.

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:36.950
I'm sorry.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:49.410
Kiyoura, don't you think you're being a bit too harsh with Kotonoha?

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:51.820
You don't have to talk to her like that.

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:55.720
Itou, you're going out with Sekai, right?

00:05:57.510 --> 00:06:01.730
But I heard from Sekai that you haven't broken up with Katsura-san yet.

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:05.150
Th-That doesn't really have anything to do with you.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:06.020
Yes, it does.

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:08.580
I'm Sekai's friend.

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:14.380
Who do you like, Sekai or Katsura-san?

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:17.090
Who?

00:06:18.030 --> 00:06:23.180
I-I went out with Kotonoha at first because I liked her, but...

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:25.170
Then what about Sekai?

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:31.760
I-I think it's nicer being with her now...

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:33.710
What do you mean by nicer?

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:36.210
Do you mean because it's easier?

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:40.590
No, more like I can be myself more with her, I can relax...

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:44.180
I see. Then you'll choose Sekai, right?

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:54.810
I'll do the inspection myself.

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:58.540
You go see Sekai.

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:23.750
Makoto...

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:48.230
Y-Your mom's not home today?

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:50.140
No, she has work.

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:51.080
I see...

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:53.890
Sorry for being dressed like this.

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:56.370
No, it has its own charm.

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:57.620
Dummy!

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:02.500
Why did you skip school?

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:06.010
I-I...didn't feel so well.

00:08:08.810 --> 00:08:12.850
Oh, I see. Sorry for asking something weird.

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:17.840
I had heard that something happened with Kotonoha, so...

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:25.560
When I left your apartment, I ran into Katsura-san.

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:27.850
That's why I told you not to leave!

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:33.060
Looks like Katsura-san knows about us...

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:37.860
She was crying and saying she was your girlfriend.

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:41.870
Makoto, what should I do?

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:47.780
What we're doing is bad, right?

00:08:47.780 --> 00:08:49.670
Th-That's not...

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:53.090
I mean, this is what you want, too, right?

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:56.780
Yeah, but doing this...

00:08:57.900 --> 00:08:59.170
There's nothing wrong with it.

00:08:59.170 --> 00:09:00.050
It's wrong!

00:09:00.050 --> 00:09:01.120
No, it's not!

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:03.050
That's just too sad, Sekai!

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:12.160
The tea...

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:14.160
You can deal with it later, right?

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:16.670
No, it'll stain.

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:30.080
Did you talk with Itou?

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:32.050
Yeah.

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:35.050
So he's going to break up with Katsura-san, then?

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:36.390
Yeah.

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:38.300
That's good.

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:45.080
You rely on him, right?

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:47.830
You'll be fine if you have him, right?

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:49.230
Yeah.

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:57.400
Please don't go near him anymore!

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:00.760
1 Item
From: Itou Makoto
I like you more.

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:20.220
Sekai, what happened yesterday?

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:22.410
I had a bit of a cold.

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:26.180
Good morning, Makoto.

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:28.310
G-Good morning.

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:34.830
Sakakino Academy Fair

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:40.040
With this we should be pretty much ready for tomorrow, right?

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:41.820
Yeah, it's all set.

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:43.930
Then, I'm counting on all of you tomorrow.

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:45.800
Right!

00:10:47.970 --> 00:10:50.250
Haramasu. This is Haramasu.

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:53.710
Those wishing to transfer to the train heading towards East Harami please head to platform three.

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:53.710
Counting on me...

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:56.640
I'm not really in the mood for that right now.

00:10:56.640 --> 00:10:57.910
Makoto-kun!

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.640
Why are you here?

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:19.180
Wh-Why didn't you wait at the school station?

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:21.730
I didn't want anyone else to see me.

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:29.460
Do you want to touch them?

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:34.430
I'll let you touch them bare soon...

00:11:34.430 --> 00:11:35.600
Bare?!

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:42.970
The next time Kokoro isn't home, I'll call you...

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.480
That's when...

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:54.490
So, please dance in the folk dance with me!

00:11:58.040 --> 00:11:59.860
R-Right...

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:05.410
East Harami. East Harami.

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:16.250
Got it. I'll wait.

00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:20.390
Is Itou coming?

00:12:20.390 --> 00:12:21.310
Yeah.

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:23.270
Then I'll go home.

00:12:23.270 --> 00:12:25.500
You'll be fine now, right?

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:27.890
Yeah. Thanks, Setsuna.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:32.200
I suck.

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:39.770
<i>Yes.</i>

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:44.210
<i>An apartment in the 15th district. I'll be living there until the final living arrangements are decided.</i>

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:59.470
Sekai has Itou now, so she'll be fine.

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:07.550
Sakakino Academy Fair

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:10.350
Welcome back, Master!

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:15.870
Two coffees and a banana crepe.

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:18.380
Order up! A cola and a banana-cake.

00:13:18.390 --> 00:13:20.390
Haunted House

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:22.900
Reception

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:26.430
Um, excuse me, have you seen Mori-san?

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:28.520
Kumi? I haven't...

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:31.890
She's supposed to be on reception duty about now...

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:34.530
Well, I guess you can't help it if she's not here.

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:37.430
You'll have to do it, since you're on the planning board.

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:39.150
I guess you're right.

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:44.090
Um, Katou-san, if it's fine with you, could you take my place for just a moment?

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:48.370
Oh, we just stopped by to see how things were going. We're about to go.

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:52.040
I see...

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:53.740
Um...

00:13:54.590 --> 00:13:56.300
Welcome.

00:13:56.300 --> 00:13:58.500
Two, then?

00:13:59.140 --> 00:14:00.560
Actually, we...

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:03.750
Oh, you two want to use the Break Room?

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:09.390
Have fun.

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:17.900
We're not getting that many customers.

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:23.070
Even though it's lunch time... We're supposed to be the busiest right now.

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:26.130
Class 1 is doing a Little Sister café.

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:27.580
Please come see us, Brother!

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:30.150
Come to Class 2, grrr!

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:32.110
Take a look, grrr!

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:33.600
Come to class 3!

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:35.100
We have cute maids!

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:38.090
No luck.

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:42.680
Class 1 and 2 are pulling customers like no other.

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:44.920
We're going to lose all our customers at this rate.

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:46.900
Who cares? We'll get to relax.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:49.350
Hey, you're the one who helped plan this. How can you say that?

00:14:53.770 --> 00:14:55.210
All hands, attention.

00:14:55.450 --> 00:15:00.170
We shall now commence our special operation to secure more customers.

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:06.220
3 Costumes, 1 Maid! I want you to form Costume-Maid Units and carry out our mission!

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:08.220
Begin the mission!

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:13.900
What's happening?!

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:15.160
The AA Mission!

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:16.430
Wow!

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:19.050
Well, I guess if we go that far, we'll stand out.

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:20.460
I'm going out, as well.

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:26.290
Mark Two

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:25.090
Wasn't that too baggy for you?

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:26.270
It's the Mark Two.

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:28.270
I'll take point!

00:15:30.270 --> 00:15:33.280
Brother, Brother, let us take care of you!

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:33.280
Big Brother, come here!

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:37.010
Come! Take a look!

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:40.760
Operation AA, standby.

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:43.270
3... 2... 1...

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:44.890
Absolute Area!

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:46.520
A.T. Field, deploy!

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:02.710
Softcore porn!

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:06.670
What?! Class 3 pulled a cute and erotic double punch?!

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:10.950
Okay, mobilize all the zombies serving customers in the class room,

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:12.750
and secure any potential customers!

00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:19.060
We can't lose to Class 3. Increase the amount of little sisters trying to bring in customers!

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:26.280
Join us, Brother!

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:26.280
Zombies await!

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:29.220
A banana?!

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:36.360
No!

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:40.890
Sakakino Academy Fair

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:45.330
Mission over.

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:46.590
Give me a break.

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:48.850
I guess it's better it ended like this.

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:51.890
It could have been a disaster if the worst happened.

00:16:51.890 --> 00:16:57.040
This is pretty bad. It doesn't look like our class will be able to participate in the fair tomorrow.

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:58.670
I'll fix them by tomorrow.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:09.640
So the strong Kiyoura doesn't need anyone to lean on.

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:12.370
Looks like we'll have to, too.

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:13.520
No choice, huh?

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:15.930
What?! You're going to fix all of these?!

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:20.690
You're helping, too. There's no way that Setsuna and Itou could do it all by themselves.

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:22.390
Fine...

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:26.940
I'm really sorry.

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:29.520
I really can't skip work today.

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:30.910
Don't worry about it.

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.240
Are we the only ones left?

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:38.660
Well, everyone else helped out, so we were able to get rid of the trash and clean up.

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:40.490
Looks like everything will turn out okay.

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:42.640
All that's left is fixing the fixtures.

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:45.600
I'll let you take care of Setsuna.

00:17:45.970 --> 00:17:47.130
Why?

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:49.380
It looks like she feels she's responsible for all of this.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:52.040
Yeah, I noticed that too.

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:52.930
Good.

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:54.430
Okay, I have to get going.

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:58.390
Saionji looked pretty good in her maid outfit.

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:01.250
They're wasted on you.

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:05.710
You know, we were wearing maid outfits, too.

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:11.500
Okay, class president, we have to go get some more supplies, don't we?

00:18:23.670 --> 00:18:27.690
Did we really have to go this far to get more supplies?

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:29.970
There isn't anything left at school.

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:32.700
Itou.

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:35.690
Is there something else you forgot to buy?

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:37.700
There's something I want to tell you.

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:38.900
What is it?

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:44.570
I'm moving to France after the School Fair is over.

00:18:46.570 --> 00:18:48.580
That's pretty sudden.

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:53.450
It's not. I only decided to tell you after I made sure Sekai was taken care of.

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.400
I-I see...

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:57.900
But, why?

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:00.580
My mom is being relocated...

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:03.730
Everything's already ready.

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:08.160
The only thing I was still worried about was Sekai.

00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:12.320
Whenever there was something that bugged Sekai,

00:19:12.320 --> 00:19:14.910
she would lock herself in her room and cry all day.

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:19.170
Like when she didn't come to school the other day.

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:23.450
So far, I've always done something about it, but...

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:28.680
I won't be able to be by her side anymore,

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:34.380
so I want you to continue to stand by her in my stead.

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:35.610
Kiyoura....

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:37.190
Have you told Sekai?

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:38.960
I will soon.

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:43.540
Everything will be fine if you just keep your eyes on Sekai.

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:45.700
So, I'll leave Sekai to you.

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:47.700
O-Okay...

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.810
Hey, don't cry.

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:00.760
Need this?

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:01.710
I have one.

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:06.970
You look like you're a strong person. Don't start crying because someone teased you a little.

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:10.430
Your name's Kiyoura, right?

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:13.410
Okay, if those guys try to do something again,

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:15.750
you can just call me over and I'll do something about it.

00:20:17.050 --> 00:20:18.940
So you can count on me.

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:22.470
I know them anyway, I can talk some sense into them.

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:26.300
I don't need to rely on someone else.

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:32.420
O-Oh. Well, I guess being strong like that is good, too.

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:33.310
Strong?

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:36.860
Yeah. Maybe if you keep that up, you can become class president,

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:41.180
keep everyone in line, then no one will try to bug you anymore.

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:45.090
Me? Class president?

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:48.520
Yeah, I think you'd fit the role.

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:51.290
If you run, I'll vote for you.

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:53.050
So you should do it!

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:54.700
Okay.

00:20:55.470 --> 00:20:57.250
Looks like you stopped crying.

00:20:57.250 --> 00:20:58.100
I wasn't crying!

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:02.610
Right, right. You're strong, so you don't cry, right?

00:21:09.520 --> 00:21:10.520
Itou.

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:11.620
What is it?

00:21:12.930 --> 00:21:17.800
I was really happy when you helped me back then.

00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:19.950
Back then?

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:21.630
During freshman orientation.

00:21:22.770 --> 00:21:24.340
Oh yeah, that's right.

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:28.580
You were being picked on by Tooyama and Matsudaira because you were short.

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:31.370
But, it's not like I really helped you.

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:33.300
No, you did.

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:35.920
There were just some guys I knew from elementary school,

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:39.600
and I didn't want to see them picking on a girl.

00:21:40.220 --> 00:21:42.610
Still, it made me happy.

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:48.060
Oh. Well, you really did end up as class president, so you are something.

00:21:57.020 --> 00:22:00.800
It's pretty late. Go home and finish the rest up tomorrow.

00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:08.270
1-3 Maid Café

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:08.270
Looks like we'll be able to handle tomorrow.

00:22:08.270 --> 00:22:09.990
Yeah, I'm glad.

00:22:09.990 --> 00:22:13.420
I'm going to take a peak at what the girls' basketball team put together.

00:22:13.420 --> 00:22:15.210
Thanks.

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:18.280
No problem. This is all because you worked so hard, class president.

00:22:37.650 --> 00:22:41.100
This'll be my special memory.

00:24:47.070 --> 00:24:53.010
Next time
The Last Day of the Fair
